Gullak v3.0.0 — Major update

- Individual account creation now collects a real name for both Supervisor and Kid accounts.
- Supervisors see a Kid's real name on incoming supervision requests.
- Kids see a Supervisor's real name only after that Supervisor accepts the request.
- Real-name visibility is enforced by the cloud API; pending requests do not expose a Supervisor's real name to the Kid.
- Family mode remains unchanged.
